    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261104d-mid-7619>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700">Lampenwelt — Allemagne</p>
      <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">LED-Leuchtmittel (lampenwelt.de)</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Encarts sur les guides <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/de/ratgeber/lumen-watt/">DE Lumen/Watt</a>, <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/de/ratgeber/lampensockel-e27-e14-gu10/">Sockel</a> et <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/de/anleitungen/halogen-gu10-mr16-durch-led-ersetzen/">GU10</a>.</p>
      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=7619&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lampenwelt.de%2Fc%2Fleuchtmittel" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="7619" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Lampenwelt.de →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261104d-mid-9292>
