      <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Leuchtmittel mit Versand AT (lampenwelt.at)</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Accueil <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/de/">DE</a> et encart dédié sur <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/de/ratgeber/lumen-watt/">Lumen/Watt</a>.</p>
      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=9292&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lampenwelt.at%2Fc%2Fleuchtmittel" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="9292" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Lampenwelt.at →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261104d-mid-7574>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700">Lights.co.uk — Royaume-Uni</p>
      <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Light bulbs B22, E27, GU10 (lights.co.uk)</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Guides <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/en/guides/lumens-vs-watts/">EN</a> · accueil <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/en/">/en/</a>.</p>
      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=7574&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lights.co.uk%2Fc%2Flight-bulbs" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="7574" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Lights.co.uk →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261104d-mid-10896>
