      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Tonte autonome pour jardins privés — livraison annoncée Allemagne. Aucun code promo vérifié ce jour.</p>
      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=125144&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fde.anthbot.com%2F" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="125144" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Voir ANTHBOT DE</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261102-anthbot-us>
