      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Relais, dimmers et capteurs sur shelly.com/es — livraison Espagne. Encarts détaillés sur nos guides <a class="text-amber-700 underline" href="/es/tutoriales/interruptor-inteligente-sin-neutro/">ES</a>.</p>
      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=128973&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.shelly.com%2Fes" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="128973" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Tienda Shelly ES</a>
    </article>    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261031b-1p1a17430>
