      <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=102989&amp;awinaffid=3127458&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.netzwerkartikel.de%2F" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="102989" class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Voir Netzwerkartikel.de</a></article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" data-integration-20261031b-1p1a122030>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700">TESSAN</p>
      <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Multiprises, prises murales USB et adaptateurs de voyage (marque internationale).</h3>
